From c9421d3fc17870e1c545d1e10763502628401f17 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:56:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 404/453] fix(desktop): keep new Home sessions visible across
 sidebar views [daveey]

Use consistent provisional placement for unresolved cwd-only chats, honor authoritative Home ownership, and synthesize Home when absent. Cover previews, lanes, filtering, labels, and ownership transitions with helper and rendered regression tests. Previously cwd fallback selected a nonexistent project and tests asserted omission; regression coverage now requires a visible destination.

(cherry picked from commit 2f45b7b6865a172f45e999986393cf127cee178f)
